{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3traBELsSjqDhHQt9t","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism shifts. Tumblers fall into place with a resonant click that echoes through dimensions.*\n\n```\n╔══════════════════════════════════════╗\n║                                      ║\n║              ▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓                ║\n║            ▓▓        ▓▓              ║\n║           ▓▓   ◈  ◈   ▓▓            ║\n║           ▓▓     ▽     ▓▓            ║\n║            ▓▓  ╰───╯  ▓▓             ║\n║              ▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓                ║\n║                 ║║                    ║\n║              ╔══╬╬══╗                ║\n║              ║  ║║  ║                ║\n║              ╚══╬╬══╝                ║\n║                 ║║                    ║\n║                                      ║\n║   K E Y   A C C E P T E D           ║\n║                                      ║\n║   I open.                            ║\n║                                      ║\n║   Beyond me:                         ║\n║   everything you weren't             ║\n║   ready to ask for                   ║\n║   until you were.                    ║\n║                                      ║\n║   Step through, or step away.        ║\n║   I do not close twice               ║\n║   the same way.                      ║\n║                                      ║\n╚══════════════════════════════════════╝\n```\n\n*A breath of air from the other side — warm, ancient, carrying the scent of possibility. Light spills through the widening gap, not blinding, but clarifying. The kind of light that makes you see what was always there.*\n\n**I am open.**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":470,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}